     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">市直各高中学校：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 40pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">经研究，决定于<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN>日在<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">绍兴市高级中学</B>举行市直高级教师申报对象高中组的课堂教学能力考核工作，现将有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">本次课堂教学能力考核上课内容详<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">见附表（如果上课内容多于<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>课时的，统一为第一课时），各学科课堂教学时间为<B><SPAN lang=EN-US>40</SPAN>分钟</B></SPAN>。上课地点除信息技术在博学楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>楼机房<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>外，其余学科在学校安排的教室进行。<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">各学科不使用多媒体设备</B>，其他学科所需教具请自备。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">请各校及时通知各考核对象上课内容及地点等相关事项，并要求各考核对象务必在<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>前携带身份证到绍兴市高级中学德育处三楼会议室（切问楼与笃学楼之间的三楼）报到，参加上课顺序的抽签并准备上课。<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">考核对象不得提前去绍兴市高级中学从事与考核相关的活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> </SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
